WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,750
Jiang Yu

2
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,970
What are you doing standing here talking about something?

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:22,040
From today on, I will bear the burden of what you said about the firewood I chopped.

4
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:25,590
The salt of my life, my cure, is mine, you want it

5
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:28,100
Just give something in exchange for Jiang Yu

6
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,060
You can live alone and cure salt

7
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:39,640
Stop pretending to be a fool here.

8
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,570
Teacher Jiang really knows how to live

9
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:43,050
When did he learn it?

10
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,180
I dried the salt myself

11
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,820
You can taste it first before buying it, Mr. Jiang

12
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,580
Everyone is in trouble together

13
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:54,180
We should help each other, Ms. Chen

14
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,100
When dividing food these days

15
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,340
But no one discussed with me what happened to Su Weiwei

16
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,500
Harsh on our food

17
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,060
Don't pretend you can't see it

18
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,520
Okay, you have the ability, but don’t forget it

19
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:09,900
You are not the only one who has a destiny this morning. I know that Lin Feng wants you to change with him.

20
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:11,260
See if he wants you

21
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:14,970
Come to me after thinking about it

22
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:18,940
Teacher Jiang went solo

23
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:22,020
Can we leave Yingdi without relying on Lin Feng?
